### Options Upfront
```C#
var serverSslOptions = new SslServerAuthenticationOptions() {
    ApplicationProtocols = new List<SslApplicationProtocol>(){ SslApplicationProtocol.Http3 },
    ServerCertificate = TestCertificateExtensions.ServerCertificate
